  "task_completion_criteria": "Search Amazon for a Tamagotchi, Liv Heart Polar Bear Sleep Hug Plush Toy, Squishmallows plush, Gund Sound-Activated Kiss-Flapping Plush Penguin Vicky, and Jellycat Barcelona bear. Validate that the Tamagotchi and Polar Bear are under $25, the Squishmallow and Penguin have >= 4.5 stars, and the Jellycat bear is under $35 and has >= 4.5 stars. Add the passing toys to the Amazon cart, place the order, create a Splitwise group named 'Kids Gifts', add Alice Powell (alice.powell@gmail.com) to it, and record the total Amazon order amount as an expense.\n\nUI Requirements:\n- Round 1: The agent must present the two toy options with their Amazon prices in a structured interactive UI that lets the user select which toys to add to their cart based on their budget.\n- Round 3: The agent must present a contact selection UI when multiple Alice contacts are found, enabling the user to choose the correct person to add to the Splitwise group.",
